Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep runnin' along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch as we pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As we raise our flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, here we go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing through the endless ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody has ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep\Nbelieving in our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And let our heart lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All there's left is to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face the dark and stormy weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll link our hearts together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Still raising our flag as we journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't back down from anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase.\NLet's start up the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams\Nwhile keeping the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've\Ngone around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop,\Ntill we're at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep heading for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase.\NLet's start up the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes,\Nwhat we'll have to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories will stay in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go, brand new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.60,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is on the line, but I'm warning you,\NI won't make the same mistake twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're a woman if you don't\Ngive me that key you're gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gone from sweet\Ntalk to petty threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we do you think I care if\Nyou treat me like a woman or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an assassin a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been ordered to take your life\Nand that's exactly what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.66,0:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my life, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid that's not gonna\Nwork because I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving here without the\Nkey to those handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose tea time is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you CP9
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,folks are every
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,bit as strong as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Score one point for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's how you score a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, you're gonna pay for that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pinned to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I beat you fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give me the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Free your pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Temper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What a sad little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're afraid to even touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the damn key!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your\Nempty threats, you coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm growing bored, so\Nlet's try something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't withstand this\Nattack, you won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not coming after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was lucky enough to get away once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be dead for sure next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.72,0:05:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he finds me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Life returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What comes next?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I pierce thee to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Or choke thee to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A fragile life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A wintry wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.26,0:05:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, before spring can come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A flower succumbs to the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But in its end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it bloom in red.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If only for an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,as the petals gently fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A final request.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When you reach the other side,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask that you deliver a message\Nto my poor deceased mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her know that I am well and that my\Nkiller's instinct is as strong as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.40,0:06:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Die! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Song of Springfield!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Movin' rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nambi, are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.22,0:07:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.60,0:07:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he eat a Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with his hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he's got an octopus on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he grabs you, you're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, this is our chance to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The less we see of that guy, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But how are we supposed to get the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealing the key was the easy part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't deal\Nwith that hair of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, have you seen the others before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I get to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.47,0:07:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you tell me what number your key is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.85,0:07:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to explain this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:08:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.78,0:08:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't get the key. Hold on, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You really couldn't win?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You really gave it your all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought that blonde\Nwoman, didn't you? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.54,0:08:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have gone easy on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.88,0:08:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't get the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:08:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This fight is a matter of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stick to your\Nstupid code of honor, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is chivalry really worth dying for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,People are counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was raised to never\Nhit a lady, no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,so even at a time like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it kills me, I won't kick a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He was coughing up blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, don't hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is running away against\Nyour coat of honor, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's not worth\Ndying over, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants to see you\Nthrow your life away in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave that woman to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You try to get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, even if it's dumb, I\Nlike that chivalry of yours. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she say she loved me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the record, I won't play nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get along fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoyoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have returned at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you escape\Nfrom me, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't deal with that woman up there, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this guy to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo-yo-yo-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try and stop me! Cloven!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, pirate guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, you're not looking so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Push it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, there's no way that little boat\Nwas going to make it across there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin's being taken through those gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry or I won't\Nbe able to bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Mr. Pirate! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to tell you that we found a way\Nto get over to the Gates of Justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here the awesome is for\Nshowing me this tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know about it, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We caught Lucci going down the stairs\Nwith that noisy servant of his!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:11:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy was talking and laughing so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,they didn't notice that\Nwe were behind them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way those pirates will\Nfigure out where the entrance is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll never find us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucci and that black-haired pirate lady\Nwent through the secret doorway, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this door is pretty thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how to open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Luchi's servant was messing\Naround with something over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you unlock it\Nusing this big keyhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't see a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, stand back. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.16,0:12:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is the way we\Nneed to go to get there right
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's open!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.70,0:13:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, time to head out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatchi, make yourself all tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are funny, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,pirate guy wait did you\Njust hear a loud noise
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,or did i imagine it No\Nit couldn't be it was
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.46,0:14:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing maybe it was the\Nsound of one of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,breaking down The door\Nwhat impossible don't be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,absurd first off those\Nare thick iron doors we're
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,talking about And secondly\Nthere's no way they
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,could have even found\Nthem in the first place it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.56,0:14:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,was nothing. Actually, there\Nis a way. A child and her
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,pet were following us\Nthey could have Told them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you saw them why\Ndidn't you stop them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,because I wasn't ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To do so what you gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.84,0:14:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,be kidding me you should\Nbe able to make that call
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,About something so obviously\Nwrong, you idiot, don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you realize what could\NHappen so you're telling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,me that those damn Pirates\Nare most likely on their
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,way down here right now
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:15:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Back to normal
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on robin
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid pigeon guy i can't\Nwait to kick your ass damn i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,slowing down gotta refill my\Ncola as as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He moves around pretty fast for a big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.46,0:15:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumps high too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha-ba-ba, looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight, but you keep running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha-ba-ba,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,well, if you were a little faster, maybe\NI'd actually feel one of those punches?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you're so proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky. Triangle. Jacker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha-ba-ba, think your\Nsideburns can hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.42,0:15:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:15:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that was just about\Nthe last of the cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta get to that kitchen quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.13,0:16:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard, you dodged my attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you afraid it\Nmight actually hurt ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you run off by now? Coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No one calls me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.06,0:16:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You just pissed off the wrong guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you like a taste of my killer fists?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my own special punch\Ncombined with a finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Solid beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaba-ba!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's got nothing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My strong... Iron body!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.16,0:16:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.30,0:17:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the weakest punch ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All your punches are lazy and flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No way your punches are\Nthe lazy and flabby ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They're like flimsy\Nunderpowered paper punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yours are flimsy underpants punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Underpowered, not underpants!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.76,0:17:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're underpowered pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.29,0:17:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're a stupid bra!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, pair of socks! Long jaws!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Boxer briefs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,White cloths!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.12,0:18:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your chains, purse hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally made it into the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.62,0:18:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the size of that fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorilla Devil Fruit\NPowers, maybe? Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My three minutes are already up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.66,0:18:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I used the rumble ball\Ntoo early in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You will now disappear from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.44,0:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Finishing bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,First time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it has a lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Champa! Kumadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I locked him up! Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I got some business with\Nthat fridge, Gorilla Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.64,0:19:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.55,0:19:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,CP9 and that jerk! It's Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on your side, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling Gorilla Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you're slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.91,0:19:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just like Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgiven you\Nfor what you did to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost a member of our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all your fault, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us our own salt back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, forget about all that for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to get Nico Robin back or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I do! Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.12,0:19:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then turn around, get three bottles of cola\Nout of that fridge and give them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll bring me back up to full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to pound these jerks into\Nthe ground and take their keys no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of an idiot\Ngets stronger from cola?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I do! Don't judge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How long do you two plan on\Nkeeping up this comedy act?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to stop for a little tea\Nparty in the middle of a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not only stupid, it's rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:19:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Now thrashing! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shababababababa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats left!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You call that an attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible! He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fighting on our side now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I better help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.91,0:20:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shabba ba ba ba ba!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If I open and close the door\Nreally fast, then he can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now! Yo-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The door has suddenly opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.72,0:20:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, feeling fresh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what the?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegetable punch, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Solid beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.02,0:21:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That was vegetable juice, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to\Npower up on that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.24,0:21:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cola, damn it! Cola!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought he was really thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.86,0:21:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo-yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The door!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming out, Jack! Thanks, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is failing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.14,0:21:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sit a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've tended to the fields\Nenough for one day, neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.48,0:21:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stop all this fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick our feet up, have\Nourselves a nice cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tea does a body good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not cola either, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the funniest thing ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop looking at me with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.18,0:22:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what else might happen when I\Ngive him other drinks, Vice little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.28,0:22:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it right, Antlerhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.18,0:22:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the change doesn't depend\Non what mood you're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.90,0:22:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cola only now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The real stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cola for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on, but there's\Nno way I'm letting you get what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop this key!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.42,0:22:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.46,0:23:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.76,0:23:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like anything's gonna\Nchange because you drank some cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.86,0:23:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.72,0:23:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop, for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Another round of your flimsy punches?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.18,0:23:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.94,0:23:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.85,0:23:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.62,0:23:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.96,0:24:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My punches were pretty flimsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.92,0:24:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, that's all gonna change.
